      "rationale": "L1 explicitly names T231 as the insertion point for the HA tag in the first extracellular loop of full-length, membrane-anchored KCNC1. Python confirms residue 231 is T (residue_before=T, residue_after=Q), sits within the extracellular span 210\u2013246, and is 22 residues from the TM1 C-boundary and 16 residues from the TM2 N-boundary, satisfying the \u22653-residue clearance rule on both sides. The construct was used for cell-surface expression assays, demonstrating successful trafficking to the plasma membrane. Full-length KCNC1-HA construct with a 9-aa HA tag inserted after T231 in the first extracellular loop (S1\u2013S2 linker, topology residues 210\u2013246); used in cell-surface expression assays in a heterologous expression system.",
